  "bodyHash": "FVaqrs5CLLk=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/N87a3Q8.png\" width=\"420\" height=\"124\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-專用-d9aa6b?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=condaforge&amp;logoColor=d9aa6b&amp;labelColor=26303d\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-core\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/需要-Upgraded Core-F16436?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;labelColor=1C1C1C\" width=\"239\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-trims/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.20.1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.20.x-積極開發中-green?style=plastic\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">請使用CurseForge下載，請勿重新托管檔案。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">此模組可用於任何模組包。（在CurseForge上）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;目前暫無Fabric版本的計劃，敬請見諒。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">若想獲得更多內容，請查看<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">升級版額外飾邊</span></a></span></span><span style=\"color:#f00\">。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">模組介紹</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">為所有飾邊材料添加實用效果。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">效果說明</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/sFjod2T.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e3d4c4\">守護</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">10%機率抵抗負面效果。（可疊加）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/kw8qnd6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ececec\">防禦者</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">減少0.25點所受傷害。（可疊加）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/yzaIHYY.png\" alt=\"\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#625859;text-decoration:underline\">堅壁</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">減少10%所受傷害。（可疊加）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/c8AcQjp.png\" alt=\"\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#971607;text-decoration:underline\">紅石步伐</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">增加5%衝刺速度。（可疊加）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">行走時可激活紅石線。（需穿戴靴子）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/RjaMEIO.png\" alt=\"\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#b4684d;text-decoration:underline\">導電體</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">25%機率將閃電引向自身。（可疊加）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">免疫閃電傷害。（需穿戴全套）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/WBkJMTZ.png\" alt=\"\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#deb12d;text-decoration:underline\">幸運</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">增加1點幸運值。（可疊加）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">使豬布林對你保持中立。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/93RJL6w.png\" alt=\"\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#11a036\">言語</span><br>增加與村民的聲望20%。（可疊加）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mr52ygA.png\" alt=\"\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#6eecd2\">堅固</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">物品耐久度增加50%。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">（耐久加成只能透過鑽石或修補附魔修復）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EAtx0hT.png\" alt=\"\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#416e97\">閃亮</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">物品附魔能力增加50%（最高10點）。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#9a5cc6\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/uhBl5LG.png\" alt=\"\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">增幅</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">增加有益效果持續時間10%。（可疊加）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>其他模組</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.20 + 版本</span></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DDjo2cf.png\" width=\"262\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oC1EQZw.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-totems\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/W7CebyS.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/n9kZnB2.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-gear-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/utZxZ4t.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"62\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">舊版本</span></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VV3KsKX.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iAwAGmm.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QL8sbmz.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EHr3tPZ.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-creativerite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2lTS4p1.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-aetherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g7c0DLT.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n\n（注：已保留所有HTML標籤及圖片連結，僅對文字內容進行繁體中文本地化翻譯，包括專業術語如「飾邊」、「模組」、「附魔」等均採用台灣地區常用譯法）",
